## API Summary Table

| Endpoint | Method | Auth | Description |
|----------|--------|------|-------------|
| `/api/auth/login` | POST | Public | Login with access validation |
| `/api/invitations` | POST | Coach | Create invitation |
| `/api/invitations/:token/accept` | POST | Public | Accept invitation + signup |
| `/api/check-ins` | POST | Client | Submit daily check-in |
| `/api/check-ins` | GET | Client | Get own check-in history |
| `/api/coach/review-queue` | GET | Coach | Get unreviewed check-ins |
| `/api/check-ins/:id/review` | PATCH | Coach | Mark check-in reviewed |
| `/api/sessions` | POST | Coach | Log completed session |
| `/api/packages` | POST | Coach | Assign new package to client |
| `/api/clients/:id` | GET | Coach | Get client details + package status |
| `/api/clients/:id/override-access` | PATCH | Coach | Toggle coach override |

